WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.480
<b>0 days until the Summer Festival</b>

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.480
<i>It's the day of the Hoshi Festival.</i>

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.710
<i>Mom, it's finally here.</i>

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:10.230
<i>Together, we'll make this 
the best Art Session ever.</i>

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.680
<i>You just watch.</i>

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.250
Good morning, Ichijoji-kun.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.250
Good morning.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.090
Morning.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.350
Good morning.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.050
Morning.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.390
Huh? You're all here early.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:39.770
Morning.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:42.380
Monet got here before me.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.640
Shut up.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.710
Suminomiya-senpai, good morning.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.650
Wow. Sumi, isn't this the first 
time you haven't been late?

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.530
You're actually on time for 
the day of the festival.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:56.030
I just happened to wake up.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.620
It's nearly time.

00:00:57.970 --> 00:01:04.100
Yeah. Today the seven chosen warriors will 
bring a miraculous light to Hoshigei!

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:05.890
Heroes?

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:07.630
Rin Rin, nice one.

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:08.570
I'm on fire.

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.900
Sounds stupid, but I don't mind it.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:12.500
Right?

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:16.240
We made it this far

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:19.640
thanks to the super strict
 guidance of Director Georgie.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.960
Director?

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.390
Director Ichijoji, your strictness 
was the best we could've asked for.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.080
The volleyball training 
was certainly sensational.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.400
Thanks, Ichijoji.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.880
I only did what I was supposed to do.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.290
Are you blushing?

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:38.950
How cute.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:45.200
Please perform a final check 
on each of your areas.

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.460
The next time we'll meet will be 
one hour before the Art Session.

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:52.960
We'll make any final adjustments 
in this conference room then.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.310
Yeah!

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:56.500
It's finally today.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.970
Let's do this, Tsukushi.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.400
Hibiki, calm down.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.220
Let's go make our rounds.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.220
Let's do our best, Ichijoji-kun.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:03.940
Huh? Where's my checklist?

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.940
Of course.

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:06.400
Anjo-senpai, how could 
you lose yours already?

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.980
Rintaro, I'm hungry.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:27.180
<b>Magic-Kyun Renaissance!</b>

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:41.990
The Festival of Miracles and Magic

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:45.970
I'm looking forward to 
hearing Teika-kun sing.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:50.000
He'd better not do anything to 
embarrass the Ichijoji family name.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.470
It's been a while, Masana-senpai.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:58.930
Ah, yes. It's been a while, Todo.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:02.130
The festival is lively again this year.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.480
Have you come to see the Art Session?

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.140
Yes.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.470
Reminds you of the past, doesn't it?

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.730
Fate is a curious thing.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.970
I can't believe members of both the 
Ichijoji and Aigasaki families

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:19.480
will be performing in an Art Session again.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.680
It's just a coincidence.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:28.580
If anything, it's an opportunity 
to crush the Aigasaki family.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.500
No one can beat Teika-kun.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.850
Of course.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:37.000
Enjoy the Art Session.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.630
What does that mean?

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.280
Why don't you see for yourselves?

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.200
<i>The Hoshinomori Summer 
Festival will now begin.</i>

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:55.890
Don't push. Move forward slowly, please.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.900
<b>Hoshinomori Summer Festival</b>

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:58.900
Thank you for coming.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:02.560
Thanks for coming, kitty cats.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:06.590
Here's some sexy pamphlet 
distributing to thank you.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.960
Senpai, keep your shirt buttoned.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:15.410
What? Why?

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:17.890
Delicious food.

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:18.980
Freshly made.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.670
Welcome. Stop by.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.730
Good morning.

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:25.880
I'm here to check on the merchandise.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.180
Welcome.

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.640
Thanks for your hard 
work. Take this with you.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.390
Wow, thanks.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.270
This is...

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:37.770
What? Is something wrong?

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:41.190
This coffee is from Costa Rica.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.530
It has a sweet aroma and refined acidity.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.760
But, with the way it's roasted,

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.910
it won't give my brush enough energy.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.860
Everything looks okay.

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:51.700
Good luck today.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.670
Wow.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:54.790
There's so much Light of Arte.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.790
That's Hoshigei for you.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:56.540
How cute.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.820
Incredible. This is a masterpiece.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:01.290
It's well made.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.090
Thanks to the executive committee,

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.970
we have enough people to carry the shrine.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:07.610
Let's do our best at the parade.

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:08.300
Yeah!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.310
Try not to cause any accidents.

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:12.830
We're counting on you.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.510
This is for you.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:16.290
What?

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:17.310
Are you sure?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.980
Everyone loves the crepes 
Hibiki taught us how to make.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.660
We have nothing but gratitude.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.070
<b>Colorful Crepes</b>

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.070
Welcome.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:29.030
Thanks. I don't know what 
I would've done without this.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:31.660
No good?

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.030
I guess I'll fry it, then.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:37.540
No. This isn't for sale.

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.150
Good work.

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:43.740
That's everything we need 
to check this morning.

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:46.590
So, is it too late to submit an application?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.720
No. Allow me to explain the specifics.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.740
There are two ways to get 
an application approved.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:54.220
Did you talk to Teika?

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.310
Yeah, a little.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.610
I've never seen Ichijoji-kun 
like that before.

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:03.320
He was singing such a sad song.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:08.560
Teika has been good at 
singing since he was a kid.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.820
His brothers had great expectations for him.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:13.870
Expectations?

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:17.120
That he would sing for the family.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:23.220
He's never been able to disappoint people.

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:30.010
But... he's been changing a 
little since he met you.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.260
What?

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:35.010
I believe in Teika.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.510
Let's see. It's over here, right?

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:47.020
Theater cafe, theater cafe...

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.170
Guess who.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.340
What? Wh-Who...?

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.530
Juri.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:57.530
Huh?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.890
That outfit...

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:05.420
Welcome back, miss.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.490
Huh? What?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.510
<b>Theater Cafe

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.510
Welcome to the theater cafe.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.040
<b>Theater Cafe</b>

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.680
Juri, this is amazing.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:24.870
Witness the vivid power of 
acting that resides inside me.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:26.930
Juri-sama.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:28.320
She's so handsome.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.770
Kohana, I'll treat you to some cake.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.210
Oh, sorry.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:36.320
I need to leave soon since I have 
to get ready for the Art Session.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:39.580
I see. I'm really looking forward to it.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.020
Yeah, thanks. I'll do my best.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:48.340
Mom.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:51.340
Huh? Are you lost?

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.550
Don't forget anything, guys.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.940
Aigasaki-senpai's late.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:01.930
How unusual. My little flower is never late.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:08.390
You're Aigasaki's daughter.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.940
Yes, I'm Aigasaki Kohana.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.320
Huh.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:20.050
Today is Teika-kun's big moment.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:24.500
You'd better not do 
anything to hold him back.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.830
The Art Session is a group performance.

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:33.340
We're only here to hear Teika-kun sing.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.210
But...

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:38.650
The Aigasaki family is 
as imperceptive as ever.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:39.220
What?

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:43.920
Don't you realize that 
our families are rivals?

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:48.850
Today's Art Session is also a 
battle between you and Teika.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:54.110
What? Do you have a problem with that?

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.360
Brothers, stop.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.110
Teika-kun.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:00.240
That's enough.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.390
What?

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:06.620
Aigasaki doesn't call people enemies 
or allies, even in her dreams.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:10.630
We live in completely different worlds.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.880
Different worlds?

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:22.890
I've worked hard to make 
the Art Session a success.

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:30.520
I was able to do that because 
I had her and the others.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.680
Teika-kun.

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:38.280
I hope you enjoy the Art Session.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.940
Excuse us.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.940
Let's hurry. Everyone's waiting for us.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:53.840
Teika-kun, why?

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:56.300
I don't believe this.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.060
Ichijoji-kun.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:14.750
I'm not sure what you meant 
by different worlds.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:19.400
But, we've all been working together, right?

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:24.160
Doesn't that mean we're in the same world?

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.130
Come on. Let's go.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.630
Hurry.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:49.390
They're here.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.480
You're both late.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.660
Sorry.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.900
We didn't know what to do without 
our chairman and vice-chairwoman.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.130
Let's have some fun with the Art Session.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:02.990
There are things that only we can do.

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:06.990
Yeah.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.250
It's almost time.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.130
I'm so nervous.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:22.840
My little flower, believe in yourself.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:26.970
And believe in us too, senpai.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.960
If we work together,

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.810
we can even make miracles happen.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.610
We'll always protect you.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:40.840
You gave us something precious.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:43.360
This time, we'll give something to you.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.360
It's all right. I'm sure you can do it.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.370
Thank you.

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:53.500
Our hearts are one now, aren't they?

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.120
I know we can do it.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:13.400
<i>On a stage that's sure to 
glitter more than a dream</i>

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:16.730
<i>Together we'll play</i>

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.360
<i>Dreamin' Starlight Dreamin' Night</i>

