<i>SHINY RAY</i>

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:31.620
<i>A melody that crosses the 
night sky connecting the stars</i>

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:36.920
<i>Even my emotions overflow from my body</i>

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:43.260
<i>Let's climb a rainbow high in the sky</i>

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:49.550
<i>Like a colorful palette it brings us smiles</i>

00:13:49.550 --> 00:14:01.270
<i>The rising sun makes sleeping 
buds bloom beautifully</i>

