<i>On a stage that's sure to 
glitter more than a dream</i>

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:10.070
<i>Together we'll play</i>

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.120
<i>Dreamin' Sunrise Dreamin' Sunrise</i>

