<i>I'll squeeze your hand and never let go</i>

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.880
<i>Our fortunes quietly overlap</i>

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.380
<i>Dreamin' Sunrise Dreamin' Day</i>

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.970
<i>SHINY RAY</i>

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:42.810
<i>The world's light shared 
its excitement with us</i>

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:48.740
<i>They're ringing the bells 
of miracles and magic</i>

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:54.200
<i>Tie all the fragments of our wishes together</i>

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.540
<i>And you can hear it, you can see it</i>

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.870
<i>With a one-two-three</i>

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:02.040
<i>Step by step to the sky</i>

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:07.490
<i>On a stage that's sure to 
glitter more than a dream</i>

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:10.850
<i>Together we'll play</i>

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:13.930
<i>Dreamin' Starlight Dreamin'  Starlight</i>

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:19.310
<i>I'll squeeze your hand and never let go</i>

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.650
<i>Our fortunes quietly overlap</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.110
<i>Dreamin' Starlight Dreamin' Night</i>

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:27.230
<i>SHINY RAY</i>

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.510
Kohana!

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.910
Magic-Kyun for you!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.910
Peace.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.210
Magic.

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.460
Kyun.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:17.960
Renaissance.

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:23.370
Do I look okay? Does this look weird?

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.320
What are you talking about? You look cute.

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.800
That looks fantastic on you.

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:32.130
Thanks. You look great, too.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:32.920
Well, yeah.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:43.900
Senpai, over here.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.400
That's a cute dress.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:49.150
Go on.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:50.550
Okay.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:53.690
It's Juri-sama.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.410
Should we talk to her?

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.410
She's so wonderful.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:01.910
The Light of your combined 
Artes is still shining.

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:06.450
Fantastic. What a fantastic Art Session.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:09.090
Thank you, Shinra-niisan.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:14.420
We thought you were a child 
that needed to be looked after.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:17.430
But you've grown into a real man, Teika-kun.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:20.430
You worked really hard.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:27.650
You know I once participated 
in the Art Session, don't you?

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:28.190
Yes.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:32.320
Aigasaki Sakura was part of the session then.

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:37.440
I could only think about beating her.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:41.630
But she didn't care about winning or losing.

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:44.090
My experience was similar 
to yours in that way.

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:50.310
However, we didn't have 
the relationship you have.

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:52.590
Until the end, we lived in separate worlds.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:57.720
Teika-kun, take good care of your new world.

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.350
I will.

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:04.600
From now on, follow the path you believe in.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.290
I will. Keep watching me.

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.230
And you can expect great things from me, too.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:16.240
I will exceed your expectations 
and go even further.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:39.210
<i>Aigasaki-senpai, I'll never forget 
this year's Hoshi Festival.</i>

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:42.600
<i>I had tons of fun because 
I experienced it with you.</i>

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:48.360
<i>My little flower, you dance 
as lightly as a feather.</i>

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.810
<i>Tres bien. You did very well.</i>

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:57.610
<i>Hana-chan-senpai, everything about me
 has changed since meeting you.</i>

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.860
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:03.710
<i>Everyone in the tent was smiling.</i>

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:06.790
<i>Aigasaki, it's all because of you.</i>

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.800
<i>From the bottom of my heart, thank you.</i>

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:18.870
That was seriously the 
best Hoshi Festival ever.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.730
Thanks, Juri.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:23.840
Kohana, you really are amazing.

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:26.930
You took six totally different 
people and brought them together.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:30.050
What? It wasn't me.

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:32.150
Everyone pitched in.

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:34.280
Well, they're here.

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:36.570
Those guys.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:47.330
The last dance is next.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.580
You have to decide.

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:52.080
Right now.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.210
Take one of our hands.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.590
We're waiting.

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:01.980
What will you do, princess?

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:02.910
What?

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.560
Let's dance.

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.330
Hey!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.280
Ichijoji really got us.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.780
We can let him have her for tonight.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:41.650
Ichijoji-senpai hasn't danced at all tonight.

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:43.050
It can't be helped.

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:46.180
Teika has changed.

00:20:55.890 --> 00:21:00.230
Thank you for saying you love my singing.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:03.240
Ichijoji-kun.

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:05.740
Call me Teika.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.700
Could it be?

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.420
Here we go.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:41.490
Hurry, hurry.

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:44.150
Smile.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:45.330
Three.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:46.650
Two.

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.910
One.

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:28.100
It's not good to cut loose too 
much over summer vacation,

00:23:28.100 --> 00:23:29.760
but they did work hard.

00:23:29.980 --> 00:23:32.500
Well, I guess I'll overlook it.

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:34.260
Next time on Magic-Kyun! Renaissance:

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>A Heart-Pounding Summer Holiday</b>

00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:35.930
"A Heart-Pounding Summer Holiday."

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:38.430
I have to say it, too?

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:39.930
Magic-Kyun for you.
